{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=billy_6B
|description=  
Billy pole-vaults feet-first at the opponent. 
* Goes very far, but is unsafe on block and loses to High Dodge Attack.
* Goes over low attacks and projectiles. 
* Space this move to make it safe, perhaps even plus.
